forestmaster master woodsman undead ranger~
the Forestmaster~
You are chilled by the presence of the Forestmaster.
~
You would hardly notice this figure save for the faint glimmer surrounding
him as he slowly fades in and out of view.  It is as if he leaves this plane
of existence for a brief period, only to be pulled back moments later.  The
Forestmaster moves with an ease that suggests he is quite at home in his
surroundings, yet a fire seems to burn within his eyes.  Perhaps it is
driving passion, perhaps it is consuming rage...
~
